    "floating_certificate": "Actual rounded w-1 must meet relative neutrality and conservative nonnegative proxy-gain roundoff certificate; JAX optimization barrier retained",
    "projection": "q=C-A*(A dot C)/(A dot A), zero A uses q=C; second numerical projection is exact-real idempotence",
    "scale": "tau=rho_t/max(max_abs(q),0.01); w=1+tau*q"
  },
